    "title": "Silly Billy Hit Single Real",
    "description": "Last Friday, Hit Single Real - a night music battle got a funny update with a bunch of new songs, one of them being silly billy.\r\nIn silly billy, Boyfriend is confronting Yourself who is behind the mirror. Yourself is not an corrupted BF.EXE, it's actually BF in alternate universe. You'll also see a GF verison of Yourself during the lyrics part which she also sing along aside yourself in spirit. So, Where's the real girlfriend at? Where can GF be?\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY?\r\n- Make arrows perfectly match.\r\n- Beat all enemies (Daddy Dearest, Mommy, twiddlefinger), climb to the top rank!\r\n- Feel digital rhythm! Dance with cg5! Rock the beat!\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURE\r\n- Arrows fall follow digital melody\r\n- All mods Full enemies as you expected (Indie cross, Impostor V5, twiddlefinger)\r\n- Fantastic background with great sound effects\r\n- Always save your journey while you exit the game\r\n- Updated a bunch of new funny songs\r\n- Be updated frequently!\r\n\r\nHave fun!\r\nFollow us on social media platform for any issues!",
